      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(\\log1=0,\\) the graph passes through \\((1,0)\\) and therefore cuts the \\(x\\)-axis. It cannot cut the \\(y\\)-axis because \\(x=0\\) is outside its domain.\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
